---
title: Instant Pot Hard Boiled Eggs
source: https://www.allrecipes.com/article/instant-pot-hard-boiled-eggs/
---

Place the egg steamer or trivet in the bottom of the #instant pot{}.

Add @eggs{1-12} without stacking them on top of each other.

Add @water{1%cup}.

Pressure cook on high for ~{5%minutes}.

Natural release for ~{5%minutes}, then quick release any remaining pressure.

Transfer eggs to an ice bath and soak for ~{5%minutes}.

Peel and serve.
